@startuml allergy_safety
title Sequence 5: Allergy Safety Hold Execution Flow

participant Sim as "SimulationEngine"
participant Pipe as "ExecutionPipeline"
participant RuleEng as "RuleEngine"
participant State as "StateManager"

Sim -> Pipe : execute_action(VERIFY_PRESCRIPTION)
Pipe -> State : build_input_context()
State --> Pipe : InputContext(allergies=['Penicillin'], drug_class='Beta-Lactam')
Pipe -> RuleEng : evaluate(InputContext)
Note over RuleEng: Evaluates RULE-CLIN-ALLERGY-001 (Priority 90, Level 2 Clinical Safety)
RuleEng --> Pipe : DecisionResult(status=BLOCKED, winning_rule='RULE-CLIN-ALLERGY-001', events_to_emit=['PrescriptionAllergyConflictDetected'])
Pipe --> Sim : ExecutionResult(success=False)
Sim -> Sim : emit DomainEvent(event_type='PrescriptionAllergyConflictDetected', status='BLOCKED_FAILURE')
@enduml
